@startuml
!theme plain
skinparam backgroundColor #FEFEFE
skinparam ActivityBackgroundColor #E8F4FD
skinparam ActivityBorderColor #2980B9
skinparam ActivityDiamondBackgroundColor #FFF3CD
skinparam ActivityDiamondBorderColor #F0AD4E
skinparam ArrowColor #2C3E50
skinparam NoteBackgroundColor #FFFDE7
skinparam NoteBorderColor #F9A825
skinparam PartitionBackgroundColor #F8F9FA
skinparam PartitionBorderColor #6C757D
skinparam defaultFontName "Segoe UI"

title **End-to-End EEG Emotion Recognition Pipeline**

|#E8EAF6| Data Loading |
start
:Load DEAP .mat files
from **archive/** directory;
note right
  Per subject: **s01.mat** ... **s32.mat**
  Raw shape: [40 trials x 40 channels x 8064 samples]
  (32 EEG + 8 peripheral channels)
end note
:Select 32 EEG channels
Create **SubjectData**(subject_id, eeg, labels);
note right
  EEG shape: **[40 x 32 x 8064]**
  Labels shape: **[40 x 4]** (val, aro, dom, lik)
end note

|#E8F5E9| Preprocessing |
:Apply **Bandpass Filter**
4th-order Butterworth, 4-45 Hz
(zero-phase via filtfilt);
:Apply **Notch Filter**
50 Hz, Q=30
(power line removal);
:Apply **Baseline Correction**
Subtract mean of first 3s (384 samples)
Discard baseline period;
note right
  Shape: **[40 x 32 x 7680]**
  (60s stimulus @ 128 Hz)
end note

|#FFF3E0| Segmentation & Features |
:Segment into **3-second windows**
window=384 samples, step=384 (no overlap);
note right
  40 trials x 20 windows/trial
  Shape: **[800 x 32 x 384]**
  Trial IDs tracked for GroupKFold
end note

:Extract **Feature Set** per window;
note right
  DE (histogram): 32 features (1/channel)
  HFD (Higuchi): 32 features (1/channel)
  Statistical: 128 features (4/channel)
  Hjorth: 96 features (3/channel)
  Band Power: 128 features (4 bands x 32 ch)
  Connectivity: 12-24 features
end note

:Flatten to feature matrix **X**;
note right
  Example (DE + HFD):
  Shape: **[800 x 64]**
end note

|#FCE4EC| Labeling |
:Build binary labels from
self-report ratings;

if (Label mode?) then (binary)
  :y = 1 if rating > 4.5, else 0;
else (other modes)
  :three_class / quartile /
  subject_mean / regression;
endif

note right
  Labels shape: **[800]**
  Groups shape: **[800]** (trial IDs)
  One set per dimension (valence / arousal)
end note

|#F3E5F5| Model Pipeline |
:Build **sklearn Pipeline**;

if (Model needs scaler?) then (yes: SVM, LogReg, MLP)
  :StandardScaler or RobustScaler;
else (no: XGBoost, RF, HGB)
endif

if (Feature selection?) then (MI)
  :SelectKBest(mutual_info, k);
elseif (Feature selection?) then (L1)
  :SelectFromModel(LogReg L1);
elseif (Feature selection?) then (PCA)
  :PCA(variance=0.95);
else (none)
endif

:Attach **Classifier**
(XGBoost / RBF-SVM / RF / HGB / ...);

|#E0F2F1| Evaluation |
:Run **Subject-Dependent** nested CV
(see Diagram 3 for detail);

:Aggregate window predictions to
**trial-level** via majority vote;

:Compute metrics per fold:
Accuracy, Balanced Acc, F1 macro,
ROC-AUC, Confusion Matrix;

:Average across subjects
Report mean +/- std;

|#EFEBE9| Output |
:Write **experiment_report.json**
(full fold-by-fold results);
:Write **summary.csv**
(per-fold metrics table);
:Write **summary.txt**
(human-readable overview);

stop

@enduml
